# lfgrass: shader sources are always LF. include_str! embeds the bytes as
# checked out, and the renderer edits them as LF text; a CRLF checkout (Git
# for Windows' core.autocrlf) silently dropped the far grass.
*.vert text eol=lf
*.frag text eol=lf
*.comp text eol=lf
*.glsl text eol=lf
*.spv binary
